{
  "domain": "agent-card",
  "what": "A2A 签名卡片：/.well-known/agent-card.json 的 1 条路由。response 是搬之前录下来的，由 scripts/route-replay-test.mjs --record 写入，不手改。上卡的 SOP 要发布并绑定，布置起来牵扯别的域，这里没有；那一段等搬 /api/bindings 时补。",
  "routes": ["GET /.well-known/agent-card.json"],
  "exempt": [
    { "route": "GET /.well-known/agent-card.json", "class": "unauthorized", "why": "卡片是公开的：登录门特意放行它（login-gate.ts 的公开路径清单），没有会被拒的身份", "shown_by": "gated/anonymous" },
    { "route": "GET /.well-known/agent-card.json", "class": "invalid", "why": "这条路由不读查询串、路径参数和请求体，没有会被拒的输入：带畸形参数的请求照常应答", "shown_by": "open/junk-query" }
  ],
